            "question": "A 22-year-old tall, eunuchoid male is evaluated for infertility. Physical examination reveals long lower extremities, bilateral gynecomastia, small, firm, atrophic testes (< 4 mL), and sparse facial and pubic hair. Semen analysis demonstrates azoospermia. What is the karyotype and endocrine profile?",
