            "question": "A 32-year-old male presents following a motor vehicle collision with severe forearm pain and deformity. Radiographs demonstrate a fracture of the proximal third of the ulna associated with anterior dislocation of the radial head. What is this eponymic fracture-dislocation, and which nerve is most vulnerable to injury?",
