                "B": "INCORRECT: Acute stress disorder; Zolpidem is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                "C": "INCORRECT: Panic disorder; Clonazepam is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                "D": "INCORRECT: Adjustment disorder; Trazodone is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
