              "high_yield_pearl": "PTSD vs ASD: Trauma symptoms < 1 month = Acute Stress Disorder (ASD); > 1 month = Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder (PTSD). Treatment: SSRI + Trauma-focused CBT. Prazosin (alpha-1 blocker) for trauma nightmares."
