            "question": "A 25-year-old driver experiences sudden daytime sleep attacks, loss of muscle tone triggered by laughter (cataplexy), and terrifying hallucinations while falling asleep (hypnagogic). CSF analysis reveals deficiency of which neuropeptide?",
