              "high_yield_pearl": "Opioid Overdose Triad: Miosis + Respiratory depression + Coma. Antidote: Naloxone IV/IM/intranasal. (Note: Meperidine and Propoxyphene can cause mydriasis/dilated pupils due to anticholinergic/seizure effects)."
