            "question": "A 24-year-old female presents with recurrent suicidal threats, chronic feelings of emptiness, intense fear of abandonment, unstable interpersonal relationships alternating between idealization and devaluation ('splitting'), and marked impulsivity. Which personality disorder is this, and what is the treatment of choice?",
